    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"making the most of it\" though. that just feels like a way to distract yourself from the truth. if the entire universe is just moving toward total emptiness, then any \"meaning\" we create is just a temporary hallucination. it feels like we're just running in place, pretending that our little lives matter when they objectively don't. it's exhausting to keep up the act.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
